  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat (180°C).",
    "Cut the pork belly into small pieces and season with salt, black pepper, smoked paprika, and crushed red pepper flakes.",
    "Thread the pork belly, rocket, and cilantro onto the cedar plank.",
    "Brush the cedar plank with cedar-infused olive oil and lime juice.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Brush the skewers with Fodmap-Friendly Stir-Fry Sauce during the last 2 minutes of cooking.",
    "Remove from heat and let it rest for 2 minutes before serving."
